    "summary": "Bearer: an **ORKS INFANTRY** model, not a **WEIRDBOY** model.\n\nThe bearer's ranged attacks get **[[ANTI-INFANTRY 4+]](vsdata:weapon-ability/anti)**, **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** and **[SUPA-HAZARDOUS]**.\n\n**[SUPA-HAZARDOUS]**: whenever a unit gets **selected to shoot**, once it has resolved all its attacks, it makes 2 [hazard rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls) per **[SUPA-HAZARDOUS]** weapon picked for it during its [Select Weapons](vsdata:core-rule/select-weapons) step.",
